{"id":"b56f83b0418112cc","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy with Free Real Arguments","display":"df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy with Free Real Arguments","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy","aliases":["68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy with Free Real Arguments","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-recursive-real-relation]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§18 p.71 / PDF 80; extension of §13 pp.43–44 / PDF 52–53","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy with Free Real Arguments"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5b845cf7d367cd\" href=\"?note=ab5b845cf7d367cd\" title=\"68-df-recursive-real-relation\">68-df-recursive-real-relation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§18 p.71 / PDF 80; extension of §13 pp.43–44 / PDF 52–53"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68-archive; local content and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{m,k}\">\\(X_{m,k}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}\\)</span> 见直接依赖。下式按层数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 作同时递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle\\)</span> 是附加一个数变量的元组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^{0,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{0,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^{0,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{0,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^{0,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in Q))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1}^{0,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in Q))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^{0,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in Q))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{n+1}^{0,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in Q))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^{0,(m,k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_n^{0,(m,k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §18 末段（印刷 p.71 / PDF p.80）对 §§13–14 的推广；正层级沿用 §13 的交替数前缀，实输入此时是自由变量而非实量词。层 0 是本目录的辅助约定。按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 递归定义对全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\">\\(m,k\\)</span> 同时进行，不是关于元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的循环定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e61d0905238a638\" href=\"?note=5e61d0905238a638\" title=\"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy\">68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</a> 的数关系类一致，但这里保留混合元数上标以供 §§19–20 复用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-real-relation","status":"resolved","id":"ab5b845cf7d367cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-real-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"5e61d0905238a638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应 §18 末段（印刷 p.71 / PDF p.80）对 §§13–14 的推广；正层级沿用 §13 的交替数前缀，实输入此时是自由变量而非实量词。层 0 是本目录的辅助约定。按 $n$ 递归定义对全部 $m,k$ 同时进行，不是关于元数 $k$ 的循环定义。$m=0$ 与 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的数关系类一致，但这里保留混合元数上标以供 §§19–20 复用。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,k,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"X_{m,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0^{0,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{0,(m,k)}:=\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{n+1}^{0,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in Q))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_{n+1}^{0,(m,k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq X_{m,k}:\\exists Q\\in\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k+1)}\\;\\forall(\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in X_{m,k}\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x)\\in R\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;((\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x\\,^{\\frown}\\langle y\\rangle)\\in Q))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_n^{0,(m,k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k)},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ArithReal}^{(m,k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{0,(m,k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{0,(m,k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"m,k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false}],"bytes":2228,"backlinks":[{"id":"4eb7f663287e8b98","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy|df-arithmetical-real-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy with Free Real Arguments]]"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","ab5b845cf7d367cd","5e61d0905238a638"]}